# 4. Unified Explorer Interface

The most important UI requirement is that all runtime components must be accessible through one unified Explorer.

Do not create separate disconnected pages for Reflection, Objects, Classes, and Services.

Design a unified navigation interface.

## Main Explorer

The main screen should contain a searchable and filterable runtime tree.

Suggested structure:

Runtime Explorer
│
├── Classes
│   ├── Loaded Classes
│   ├── DEX Classes
